{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06A5D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"为什么Peace Walker需要自爆功能？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Snake，你也看见了吧？Peace Walker头部那个不祥的球体。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"那是一枚氢弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"氢弹！？你是说那个巨大的球体就是氢弹？到底有多大的破坏力……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"很荒唐吧？过度杀伤也该有个限度。若考虑战略价值，更小的炸弹就足够了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可以说，那只不过是为了和苏联的“沙皇炸弹”抗衡而造的炸弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"双方的竞争都已经刹不住车了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"进化的死胡同……就像剑齿虎。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"当然，那么大的炸弹装不上导弹，轰炸机也载不了。所以才轮到Peace Walker出场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"一路走进敌国，抱着氢弹自爆，是吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}